# Builder-3D — project rules

## Update modal & version

- **`main.js`**: `APP_RELEASE` (`version`, `dateLabel`, `highlights`) is the canonical in-app release identity. The update modal and `#app-version-pill` read from it. `localStorage` key `builder3d-seen-release` stores the last dismissed version.
- **Shipping a release**: Bump `APP_RELEASE` and `package.json` `"version"` together; append `DOCS/CHANGELOG.md`; amend `DOCS/SUMMARY.md`; note in `DOCS/SCRATCHPAD.md`. Follow **`DOCS/RULES_RELEASES.md`** for the full checklist.

## Docs

- Do not delete content in `DOCS/*` — append or annotate per preservation headers.
- Status docs: `SCRATCHPAD`, `CHANGELOG`, `SBOM` when relevant.

## Code

- Match existing `main.js` patterns; no new dependencies without SBOM update and justification.
- Blueprint format version remains **`BLUEPRINT_VERSION`** (separate from app semver).
